-- Spirit Healers (6491) stacked on top of each other at graveyards (Four, 2026-10-31).
--
-- After the Nightsong duplicate (2026_10_31_07), a scan of all 876 Spirit Healer spawns found 80 spots
-- where two or three of them stand within 5 yards of each other with the same phase and difficulty.
-- Most extras come from one block of added spawns (guids 371188-371416, and 20549126-20549205 on the
-- Broken Isles). Each spot keeps one healer: the sniffed spawn when there is one (VerifiedBuild > 0:
-- 452538, 452539, 210117416, 210118234), otherwise the lowest guid. None of the removed guids is in a
-- pool, game event, formation or creature_addon row. Removed per map:
--   map 0 (Eastern Kingdoms): 16
--   map 1 (Kalimdor): 28
--   map 530 (Outland): 2
--   map 870 (Pandaria): 1
--   map 1220 (Broken Isles): 38
-- 371367 (Nightsong) is in this list too, so this file also covers 2026_10_31_07.
